{"root":"capek","ipa":"/ˈtʃapɛk/","core":"形容词。指身体或精神上的疲劳、疲惫、劳累。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈtʃapɛk/","zh":"疲劳的，劳累的","phrases":[{"t":"capek sekali","zh":"非常累"},{"t":"merasa capek","zh":"感到疲倦"},{"t":"capek hati","zh":"心累"}],"examples":[{"t":"Saya merasa sangat capek setelah bekerja seharian.","zh":"工作了一整天后，我感到非常疲惫。"},{"t":"Jangan terlalu capek, istirahatlah sebentar.","zh":"别太累了，休息一会儿吧。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"capek","ipa":"/ˈtʃapɛk/","zh":"疲劳的","phrase":{"t":"capek fisik","zh":"身体疲劳"},"example":{"t":"Dia capek karena kurang tidur.","zh":"他因为睡眠不足而感到疲劳。"}},{"w":"mencapekan","ipa":"/mənˈtʃapɛkan/","zh":"使人疲劳的","phrase":{"t":"pekerjaan mencapekan","zh":"令人疲惫的工作"},"example":{"t":"Tugas ini sangat mencapekan pikiran.","zh":"这项任务非常耗费心神。"}},{"w":"kecapekan","ipa":"/kətʃapɛkan/","zh":"过度疲劳","phrase":{"t":"jatuh sakit karena kecapekan","zh":"因过度劳累而病倒"},"example":{"t":"Dia jatuh sakit karena kecapekan bekerja.","zh":"他因为工作过度劳累而病倒了。"}}],"derSlugs":["capek","mencapekan","kecapekan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:48:52.853Z","src":"base"}